# Detections

## Purpose

This folder contains detection rules developed during the Windows security monitoring and threat detection investigation.

## Detection Objectives

The project will explore detection opportunities involving:

- User account creation and modification.
- Privileged group membership changes.
- Process creation activity.
- Windows security logging activity.

## Detection Documentation

Each detection rule will document:

- Detection name and objective.
- Relevant Windows Event IDs.
- Conditions and detection logic.
- Expected detection behaviour.
- Testing results.
- Known limitations and potential false positives.

## Detection Development

Detection rules will be developed using observed Windows security events and validated through controlled testing.

The project will distinguish between expected administrative activity and potentially suspicious behaviour.

## Current Status

Detection development has not yet started.
